    wordCount: 463,
    backlinks: ["moc-engineering-mathematics","arcface","face-alignment","matrix"],
    links: ["face-alignment","arcface","poetry-matrix"],
    outline: [{"level":1,"text":"Coordinate Geometry","id":"coordinate-geometry"},{"level":1,"text":"BASIC FORMULAS","id":"basic-formulas"},{"level":2,"text":"Distance Formula","id":"distance-formula"},{"level":2,"text":"Section Formula","id":"section-formula"},{"level":1,"text":"SLOPE AND LINE","id":"slope-and-line"},{"level":2,"text":"Slope","id":"slope"},{"level":2,"text":"Equation of Line","id":"equation-of-line"},{"level":1,"text":"GENERAL FORM OF LINE","id":"general-form-of-line"},{"level":2,"text":"Slope from general form","id":"slope-from-general-form"},{"level":1,"text":"ANGLE BETWEEN LINES","id":"angle-between-lines"},{"level":2,"text":"Conditions","id":"conditions"},{"level":1,"text":"DISTANCE FROM POINT TO LINE","id":"distance-from-point-to-line"},{"level":1,"text":"INTERCEPT FORM","id":"intercept-form"},{"level":1,"text":"PAIR OF STRAIGHT LINES (BASIC)","id":"pair-of-straight-lines-basic"},{"level":1,"text":"CIRCLE","id":"circle"},{"level":2,"text":"Standard Equation","id":"standard-equation"},{"level":2,"text":"General Form","id":"general-form"},{"level":2,"text":"Center and Radius","id":"center-and-radius"},{"level":1,"text":"IMPORTANT RESULTS (CIRCLE)","id":"important-results-circle"},{"level":2,"text":"Equation of diameter","id":"equation-of-diameter"},{"level":2,"text":"Tangent to circle","id":"tangent-to-circle"},{"level":1,"text":"POSITION OF POINT","id":"position-of-point"},{"level":1,"text":"PARABOLA","id":"parabola"},{"level":2,"text":"Standard Equation","id":"standard-equation"},{"level":2,"text":"Key elements","id":"key-elements"},{"level":1,"text":"ELLIPSE (BASIC)","id":"ellipse-basic"},{"level":1,"text":"HYPERBOLA (BASIC)","id":"hyperbola-basic"},{"level":1,"text":"IMPORTANT RESULTS","id":"important-results"},{"level":2,"text":"Length of tangent from point to circle","id":"length-of-tangent-from-point-to-circle"},{"level":2,"text":"Condition of tangency","id":"condition-of-tangency"},{"level":1,"text":"TRANSFORMATION TRICKS","id":"transformation-tricks"},{"level":1,"text":"CORE FORMULAS SUMMARY","id":"core-formulas-summary"},{"level":1,"text":"Questions","id":"questions"},{"level":2,"text":"🔗 Connections","id":"connections"},{"level":1,"text":"References","id":"references"}],
    content: `# Coordinate Geometry 

---

# BASIC FORMULAS

## Distance Formula
- $$\\sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2}$$

## Section Formula

- Internal division:
  $$\\left(\\frac{mx_2 + nx_1}{m+n}, \\frac{my_2 + ny_1}{m+n}\\right)$$

- Midpoint:
  $$\\left(\\frac{x_1 + x_2}{2}, \\frac{y_1 + y_2}{2}\\right)$$

---

# SLOPE AND LINE

## Slope
- $$m = \\frac{y_2 - y_1}{x_2 - x_1}$$

## Equation of Line

- Slope-intercept:
  $$y = mx + c$$

- Point-slope:
  $$y - y_1 = m(x - x_1)$$

- Two-point form:
  $$\\frac{y - y_1}{y_2 - y_1} = \\frac{x - x_1}{x_2 - x_1}$$

---

# GENERAL FORM OF LINE

- $$Ax + By + C = 0$$

## Slope from general form
- $m = -\\frac{A}{B}$

---

# ANGLE BETWEEN LINES

- $$\\tan\\theta = \\frac{m_1 - m_2}{1 + m_1 m_2}$$

## Conditions

- Parallel:
  - $m_1 = m_2$

- Perpendicular:
  - $m_1 m_2 = -1$

---

# DISTANCE FROM POINT TO LINE

- $$\\frac{|Ax + By + C|}{\\sqrt{A^2 + B^2}}$$

---

# INTERCEPT FORM

- $$\\frac{x}{a} + \\frac{y}{b} = 1$$

---

# PAIR OF STRAIGHT LINES (BASIC)

- Homogeneous equation:
  $$ax^2 + 2hxy + by^2 = 0$$

---

# CIRCLE

## Standard Equation
- $$(x - h)^2 + (y - k)^2 = r^2$$

## General Form
- $$x^2 + y^2 + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0$$

## Center and Radius
- Center: $(-g, -f)$  
- Radius: $$\\sqrt{g^2 + f^2 - c}$$

---

# IMPORTANT RESULTS (CIRCLE)

## Equation of diameter
- Midpoint of endpoints is center

## Tangent to circle
- $$xx_1 + yy_1 = r^2$$ (for circle at origin)

---

# POSITION OF POINT

- Substitute point in equation:
  - $< 0$ → inside  
  - $= 0$ → on circle  
  - $> 0$ → outside  

---

# PARABOLA

## Standard Equation
- $$y^2 = 4ax$$

## Key elements
- Focus: $(a, 0)$  
- Directrix: $x = -a$

---

# ELLIPSE (BASIC)

- $$\\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$$

---

# HYPERBOLA (BASIC)

- $$\\frac{x^2}{a^2} - \\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$$

---

# IMPORTANT RESULTS

## Length of tangent from point to circle
- $$\\sqrt{S_1}$$
  where $S_1$ is value after substitution

---

## Condition of tangency
- Discriminant = 0

---

# TRANSFORMATION TRICKS

- Shift origin:
  - Replace $x \\to x - h$, $y \\to y - k$

---

# CORE FORMULAS SUMMARY

- Distance:
  $$\\sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2}$$

- Line:
  $$y = mx + c$$

- Circle:
  $$(x - h)^2 + (y - k)^2 = r^2$$

- Distance to line:
  $$\\frac{|Ax + By + C|}{\\sqrt{A^2 + B^2}}$$

- Parabola:
  $$y^2 = 4ax$$

---
# Questions


---
## 🔗 Connections

- Landmark points in face alignment exist in 2D coordinate space → [[Face Alignment]]
- Angular distance between vectors in embedding space → [[ArcFace]]
- 2D transformations (rotation/translation) are affine operations → [[Matrix]]

---
# References`
