  'leee': {
    id: 'leee',
    title: "LEEE",
    folder: "06 - Archive",
    path: ["06 - Archive","LEEE","LEEE"],
    tags: [],
    created: "2026-05-11",
    modified: "2026-05-11",
    wordCount: 176,
    backlinks: [],
    links: [],
    outline: [{"level":1,"text":"LEEE Master Plan — Updated","id":"leee-master-plan-updated"},{"level":2,"text":"System Rules (Non-Negotiable)","id":"system-rules-non-negotiable"},{"level":2,"text":"Resource Links","id":"resource-links"},{"level":3,"text":"Lectures","id":"lectures"},{"level":3,"text":"Practice Resources","id":"practice-resources"}],
    content: `# LEEE Master Plan — Updated

**Target Date:** May 2, 2026 **Objective:** Secure IIITH CSD rank. 100% accuracy on 70% syllabus completion. Use negative marking defense on time-sink questions.

---

## System Rules (Non-Negotiable)

1. **Zero Ego:** Drop any question taking >2 minutes. Leave blanks to exploit negative marking.
2. **No Shadow Syllabus:** CO, OS, CN are NOT on LEEE. Ignore completely.
3. **Active Recall Only:** Reading without solving PYQs does not count as studying.
4. **DSA Practice = GATE-style MCQs only.** Not LeetCode. Not competitive programming.
5. **Aptitude 20 min every single day.** No exceptions.
6. **Note format:** Theory → GATE PYQs embedded → push to Quartz. Continue this for every new topic.

---
## Resource Links

### Lectures

1. [DLD One Shot](https://youtu.be/lH0sYax5Yg0)
2. [DBMS One Shot](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FchQ6wZVqsA)
3. [DM One Shot](https://youtu.be/h4sd7wRcyR0)
4. [DM Playlist](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLC36xJgs4dxEYmhzVBW7nBdftFZ4xmiF1)
5. [TOC One Shot](https://youtu.be/9kuynHcM3UA)
6. [DS One Shot](https://youtu.be/2o2vX0ZqQ_Y)
7. [Algo One Shot](https://youtu.be/aaHL0KygWqE)
8. [General Aptitude One Shot](https://www.youtube.com/live/Qgo_Np5WNls)
9. [C Programming Playlist](https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLC36xJgs4dxG-IqARhc23jYTDMYt7yvZP)
10. [Engineering Maths One Shot](https://www.youtube.com/live/XEg9Dc3-12U)

### Practice Resources

1. [GATE PYQs Subject-wise](https://practicepaper.in/gate-cse/gate-cse-subject-wise-questions)
2. [GATE CSIT Notes](https://practicepaper.in/gate-cse/gate-cse-notes)
3. [GATE Mock Tests](https://practicepaper.in/gate-cse/gate-cse-mock-test-series)`
  },

